5724","id":3831821733,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7kZPWl","user":{"login":"Lecrapouille","id":17874458,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3ODc0NDU4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17874458?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lecrapouille","html_url":"https://github.com/Lecrapouille","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lecrapouille/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lecrapouille/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lecrapouille/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lecrapouille/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lecrapouille/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lecrapouille/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lecrapouille/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lecrapouille/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lecrapouille/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-01T19:33:47Z","updated_at":"2026-02-01T19:33:47Z","body":"Not only tar.gz, zip also preserve file attributes (except if called from Windows I guess)","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3831821733/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3831969099","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115724#issuecomment-3831969099","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115724","id":3831969099,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7kZzVL","user":{"login":"MarianoGnu","id":1776044,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzYwNDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1776044?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu","html_url":"https://github.com/MarianoGnu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-01T20:37:27Z","updated_at":"2026-02-01T20:39:28Z","body":"Response from AI:\r\n>Yes, .zip files can preserve Unix file attributes, but it heavily depends on the tools used to create and extract the archive and the operating system involved. The original ZIP format, designed for MS-DOS, did not support Unix permissions, but extensions were later added. \r\n>**Windows tools:** Many Windows-based zip utilities do not capture or store the Unix-specific permissions because they are not relevant to the Windows file system (NTFS has a different permission system).\r\n\r\nSo question is, does the zip file you created still have those flags if unziped from unix terminal using tar or similar?\r\nif unziping with tar works and unziping from the AssetLib doesnt then that would confirm there's an issue that is unrelated to how the file was packed","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3831969099/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3832165234","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115724#issuecomment-3832165234","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115724","id":3832165234,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7kajNy","user":{"login":"Lecrapouille","id":17874458,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3ODc0NDU4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17874458?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lecrapouille","html_url":"https://github.com/Lecrapouille","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lecrapouille/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lecrapouille/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lecrapouille/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lecrapouille/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lecrapouille/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lecrapouille/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lecrapouille/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lecrapouille/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lecrapouille/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-01T22:25:17Z","updated_at":"2026-02-01T22:25:17Z","body":"@MarianoGnu as I said in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115720 using any zip Unix tools, my files attributes are preserved during their extraction, while Godot loose them. My patch fixed it at least for Linux (certainly also for macos since same behavior). Nowadays zip archive  preserves file attributes. You can use zipinfo for example. The ideal would be that Godot asset library accepts tar.gz and derived firmats but I did not check if it accepts, I think it is not the case.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3832165234/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3832184296","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115724#issuecomment-3832184296","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115724","id":3832184296,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7kan3o","user":{"login":"MarianoGnu","id":1776044,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzYwNDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1776044?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu","html_url":"https://github.com/MarianoGnu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarianoGnu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-01T22:36:57Z","updated_at":"2026-02-01T22:36:57Z","body":"My bad, i didn't evenrealize this was a PR because of how the wording of the title and message was written, i tough it was an issue","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3832184296/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4481393193","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115724#issuecomment-4481393193","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115724","id":4481393193,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCxyiKQ","user":{"login":"Lecrapouille","id":17874458,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3ODc0NDU4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17874458?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lecrapouille","html_url":"https://github.com/Lecrapouille","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lecrapouille/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lecrapouille/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lecrapouille/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lecrapouille/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lecrapouille/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lecrapouille/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lecrapouille/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lecrapouille/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lecrapouille/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-18T19:44:11Z","updated_at":"2026-05-18T20:04:30Z","body":"@Calinou Thank you! Yes, my fix is based on the code you linked. I also mentioned it in my post: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115720#issuecomment-4480282280. However, I did not use a permanent link, so the referenced line numbers are no longer correct.\r\n\r\n@Calinou Regarding ZIP security, there used to be a well known vulnerability (zip slip attack) where a file path such as \"../../../../../../../../../../../../../../../../etc/passwd\" could be stored inside the archive. If someone extracted the archive without proper path validation, the repeated \"../\" sequences could eventually reach the root directory \"/\". Since running \"cd ..\" from \"/\" keeps you at \"/\", the extraction process could end up overwriting the \"/etc/passwd\" file.\r\n\r\n@bruvzg ~~no worries, ZIP from Windows are considered as standard files. The GitHub actions such as [actions/upload-artifact issues 38](https://github.com/actions/upload-artifact/issues/38) may loose the Unix file permission inside the zip.~~ EDIT: I meant in my outdated-forked https://github.com/Lecrapouille/zipper project. I guess there is also no problem on Godot side EDIT-EDIT: you are right there is a possible `chmod(file, 0)`  and possible zip issue if contents_dir is empty with `String::begins_with()`  returning true if l == 0","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4481393193/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4481574148","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115724#issuecomment-4481574148","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115724","id":4481574148,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCx9lBA","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-18T20:03:33Z","updated_at":"2026-05-18T20:03:33Z","body":"> no worries, ZIP from Windows are considered as standard files.\r\n\r\nNot including Unix attributes is within the standard, if `version made by` upper byte is set to DOS (`0`), which some apps might still use for compatibility. Technically we should check for the `version made by` upper byte to be set to Unix (`3`), but not sure if all compressors always set it correctly.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4481574148/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4481641513","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115724#issuecomment-4481641513","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115724","id":4481641513,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABCyBsKQ","user":{"login":"Lecrapouille","id":17874458,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3ODc0NDU4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17874458?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lecrapouille","html_url":"https://github.com/Lecrapouille","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lecrapouille/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lecrapouille/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lecrapouille/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lecrapouille/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lecrapouille/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lecrapouille/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lecrapouille/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lecrapouille/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lecrapouille/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-18T20:10:30Z","updated_at":"2026-05-18T20:10:30Z","body":"@bruvzg I edited my comments, yes could be nice to add extra checks `(info.external_fa >> 16) != 0`  and add unit tests on ` if (base_dir != contents_dir && base_dir.begins_with(contents_dir)) {` with a dummy base_dir","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4481641513/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]